# Call-tree diff, step 5 of PR #5 (fa718bf)
# "Resolve a PR's base from the PR, and follow force-pushes"
# The tree is what the view skill tells the agent to run (see
# 02-call-tree.pr5-view-skill.txt). Hand-written from skills/view/SKILL.md.

 /pr-timeline:view <PR n>
   resolve HEAD, BASE
-    gh pr view <n> --json headRefName,baseRefName,title
-    git fetch origin pull/<n>/head:refs/pr-timeline/<n> <baseRefName>
-    git merge-base origin/<baseRefName> refs/pr-timeline/<n>
+    gh pr view <n> --json baseRefOid,title
+    git fetch origin +pull/<n>/head:refs/pr-timeline/<n> <baseRefOid>
+    git merge-base <baseRefOid> refs/pr-timeline/<n>
   git rev-parse --verify (both ends)
   serve --daemon
